@startuml Manage Time Use Case - State Diagram
title Manage Time Use Case - State Diagram

[*] --> Authenticated

Authenticated --> ViewHome: Navigate to VTS

ViewHome --> ViewBalance: Display employee balance\nand request history

ViewBalance --> SelectCategory: Employee selects\nvacation time category

SelectCategory --> EnterDetails: VTS prompts for\ndates and times

EnterDetails --> ValidateInput: Employee enters\ndetails and submits

ValidateInput --> ErrorState: Validation fails
ValidateInput --> CreateRequest: Validation passes

ErrorState --> EnterDetails: Re-display with errors\nEmployee can edit

CreateRequest --> PendingApproval: Request placed in\npending approval state

PendingApproval --> NotificationSent: Email sent to manager

NotificationSent --> ManagerNotified: Manager receives email

ManagerNotified --> ManagerViewHome: Manager logs in\nand accesses VTS

ManagerViewHome --> ReviewRequests: VTS displays requests\npending approval

ReviewRequests --> ReviewDetails: Manager selects\nand views request

ReviewDetails --> ApprovalDecision: Manager reviews details

ApprovalDecision --> Approved: Manager approves\nrequest

ApprovalDecision --> Rejected: Manager rejects\nrequest with explanation

Approved --> UpdateState: Internal state changed\nto approved

Rejected --> UpdateState: Internal state changed\nto rejected

UpdateState --> NotifyEmployee: Email notification\nsent to employee

NotifyEmployee --> ManagerHome: Manager returns to\nhome page

ManagerHome --> [*]

Approved --> EmployeeNotified: Employee notified
Rejected --> EmployeeNotified: Employee notified

EmployeeNotified --> [*]

note right of CreateRequest
  Request moves from draft
  to pending approval state
end note

note right of ApprovalDecision
  Manager must provide
  explanation if rejecting
end note

@enduml
